# Source media kept in the repo but not needed to build or serve the app.
# Railway uploads the whole working tree, and these push it past the 413 limit
# (~332 MB) that Cloudflare enforces on the upload endpoint.
#
# The copies the app actually serves live under public/ -- app/videos/page.tsx
# reads public/videos, and the badges/assets it renders are public/badges and
# public/assets. Nothing in app/, lib/, components/ or scripts/ reads the
# top-level directories below, so excluding them only shrinks the upload.
videos/
images/
audio/

.git/
node_modules/
.next/
